{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p41710","chapterId":"saedacc4831cb5e7f","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p41710-74e25ce76f4e4ba3d8cb","text":"灰毛，你一定想知道我这样的大号尘灵，在这里有什么用吧？","speaker":"尘灵"},{"id":"other-interaction-p41710-f685c6f75bd3f03e039c","text":"答案是——我也想知道！自从之前那次动乱后，我就一直被遗忘在这里了。","speaker":"尘灵"},{"id":"other-interaction-p41710-9adce0bff0c964baad70","text":"需要我找人帮帮你吗？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p41710-6b3584d66393e6c2d00c","text":"不不不，千万别去找人…我藏在这里挺好的，千万别让人想起我来。","speaker":"尘灵"}]}
